  "authorResponse": "Agree with the retained drive-condition objection after fresh derivation. Disagree with the blanket earlier no-new-Math conclusion: eb1… supplies mean ΔΦ/Δt only; the mandatory fresh I(t) graph requires local rate interpretation, and current b1dcc… whole Goal/P is the narrow available match. No symbol manipulation, secant-limit derivation or ODE competence is claimed necessary."
